# Markdown Documentation

- Use UK English spelling.
- For documentation work, use the `project-documentation` skill in `.agents/skills/`.
- Ground content in `AGENTS.md`, `composer.json`, and repository source-of-truth files under `docs/` when writing maintainer or README content.
- User-facing `website/content/` and `README.md` must not name documentation frameworks (Diátaxis, quadrants, and similar) in prose. Nav section labels are fine.
- Maintainer notes in `docs/` and agent skills may reference Diátaxis openly.
- For WordPress-oriented snippets in user docs, use WordPress Coding Standards style.
